Alembic Migrations for PillQare AI Assistant Backend

Usage
1) Configure your database URL in `.env` and ensure `app/core/config.py` exposes a sync URL for Alembic if needed.

2) Create a revision from current models (in `app/models/session.py`):
	alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Initial schema"

3) Apply migrations:
	alembic upgrade head

Notes
- Use the `alembic/versions/` folder for migration files.
- Remove or ignore any alternate migrations folder under `app/db/migrations/` to avoid confusion.